        ],
        "text": "Justice Gorsuch asked what data and criteria (e.g., two\u2011year cycles, efficiency gap) are needed to define a constitutional standard for redistricting."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Ginsburg",
        "citations": [
          {
