            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-b585cf99936d-0001-0002"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 26,
              "start": 26
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Ginsburg asked whether, in Wisconsin, a large number of uncontested districts effectively eliminates competition."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Kennedy",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "b585cf99936df6cf2c7e507c38e1df0386b5b305cc51cff1e15117132a826a59",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-b585cf99936d-0001-0003"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 27,
              "start": 27
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Kennedy asked whether a state law or amendment that mandates using all legitimate factors to favor a particular party is lawful."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Kennedy",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "b585cf99936df6cf2c7e507c38e1df0386b5b305cc51cff1e15117132a826a59",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-b585cf99936d-0001-0004"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 28,
              "start": 28
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Kennedy further asked whether such a law would violate the Equal Protection Clause or the First Amendment."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Sotomayor",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "b585cf99936df6cf2c7e507c38e1df0386b5b305cc51cff1e15117132a826a59",
            "evidence_ids": [
